# Integer16 addition promotes mixed operands

Verifies int8 and int16 addition in both operand orders produces int16 without
changing the represented values.

>>> source
narrow: int8 = 5
wide: int16 = 10

narrow_left: int16 = narrow + wide
wide_left: int16 = wide + narrow
print(narrow_left)
print(wide_left)

<<< stdout
15
15

<<< stderr
